perty spans carpet area 436 sqft.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-605-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malad-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735373034353539)\n\n![2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Sahakar Avenue at Malad West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Sahakar Avenue at Malad West\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West Mumbai\n\nNow available for sale: this 2 BHK apartment in Malad West, Mumbai.This flat is situated in Sahakar Avenue and is equipped with premium facilities. This under construction flat located in Malad West is available for purchase at price of ₹1.79 Cr. Located on Ground floor, this apartment offers carpet area of 727 sqft. The complex comprises 19 floor and provides Kids play area. The apartment provides security. P51800003995 is the RERA number of the project. You can choose 2 bhk flats units at Sahakar Avenue, priced from ₹1.57 Cr - ₹2.01 Cr.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1010-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malad-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735373034333133)\n\n![2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Gurukrupa at Jankalyan Nagar](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Gurukrupa at Jankalyan Nagar\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Jankalyan Nagar Mumbai\n\nSituated in the prime location of Jankalyan Nagar, the 2 BHK flat is currently available on sale.This unit is part of Gurukrupa, a 21 years old development. You can buy this ready to move flat in Jankalyan Nagar at price of ₹2 Cr. This property sits on 6 floor with a total carpet area of 636 sqft. The building comprises 23 floor and contains Guest Accommodation, Kids Play Pool With Water Slides.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-636-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Jankalyan-Nagar-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834353238323431)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_raj-infinia-malad-west_903.html","title":"Raj Infinia Malad West Mumbai - Price, Location, Posses