|\n| 3 BHK | 1515 | 1.97 CR |\n| 4 BHK | 2300 | 2.99 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nPayment Plans\n\n## Offers & Payment Options\n\n**Save INR 47,00,000 /- Onwards**  \n**Pay Just 5% + Govt Taxes**  \n**Subvention Till Possession | Zero GST**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Clubhouse  \n\\* Gymnasium  \n\\* Multi-purpose Hall  \n\\* Sauna and Steam  \n\\* Swimming Pool  \n\\* Kid's Play Area  \n\\* Party Lawn  \n\\* Jogging Track  \n\\* Barbeque Pavillion  \n\\* Open-Air Lounge Area  \n\\* Mini Amphitheatre\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Wooden Flooring in Master Bedroom  \n\\* Imported Marble Flooring in Living and Dining Area  \n\\* Vitrified Flooring in Kitchen  \n\\* Granite Platform, Stainless Steel Sink, Water Purifier, Piped Gas  \n\\* Vitrified Flooring in Bathrooms, Segregation of Wet & Dry Areas  \n\\* CCTV Surveillance  \n\\* Automated Elevators with Power Back-Up  \n\\* Multi Level Car Parking  \n\\* Video Door Phone with Intercom Facility  \n\\* Advanced Fire Fighting System\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/903/qra_2183.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800012243\n\n**Developer:** Rajesh Lifespaces\n\n**Project:** Raj Infinia\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Link Road near Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Link Road near Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Movie Time Cinema Hall\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about RAJ INFINIA\n\nWhere is Raj Infinia Exactly located?\n\nRaj Infinia is located at Link Road near Kanchpada, Malad West, .\n\nIs Raj Infinia Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera 