n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Raj Imperia | Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Raj Realty | Possessions | October 31, 2027 |\n| Project Sub Type | Apartment | Project Type | Residential |\n| Storey | 22 | Towers/Wings | 2 |\n| Land Parcel | Coming Soon | Rera No. | P51800078261 |\n| Per/sqft Onwards | Coming Soon | No. of Units | Coming Soon |\n| Carpet Area | 441 - 841 Sqft | Typology | 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3BHK |\n| Total Area | N/A | Security | N/A |\n\nPrice: ₹1.19 Cr\\* - 1.19 Cr\\*\n\n## Raj Imperia Key Features\n\n* Stunning City Views.\n* Designed for Modern Living with spacious layouts and natural lighting.\n* Grade A construction  quality\n* Developer of Repute\n\n## Raj Imperia Gallery\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Elevation (2)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Elevation (2).jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Elevation (3)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Elevation (3).jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Elevation](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Elevation.jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Internal-Bedroom](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Internal-Bedroom.jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Internal-Kitchen](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Internal-Kitchen.jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Internal-Dinning-Area](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Internal-Dinning-Area.jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Internal-Living-Room](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Internal-Living-Room.jpg)\n\n![Raj-Imperia-Internal-Master-Bedrroom](https://digipaces.com/storage/Raj-Imperia-Internal-Master-Bedrroom.jpg)\n\n## Raj Imperia About\n\nRaj Imperia, located in Malad West, is an exclusive 22-storey residential tower offering 1, 2, and 3 BHK apartments. With a MahaRERA registration number P51800078261, the property features carpet areas of 1 BHK (441 sqft), 2 BHK (699 sqft), and 3 BHK (841 sqft), with prices starting from ₹1.19 Cr. The possession date is set for October 1, 2027.\n\nThis project boasts a range of amenities, including Social Seating Spaces, a Children’s Play Area, an Open-Air Fitness Zone, a Rooftop Garden, a Sky Lounge, and a Gymnasium. Raj Realty ensures premium interior features such as spacious living areas with natural light, modern kitchens equipped with high-end appliances and granite countertops, luxurious bathrooms with spa-like fittings, private balconies or terraces, energy-efficient lighting, and stylish hardwood or premium tile flooring, creating an elegant and comfortable living experience.\n\nSituated at Nirlok Estate, opposite Bombay Talkies Compound, Harun Khan Road, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064, Raj Imperia enjoys excellent connectivity to Malad West, a thriving residential and commercial hub in Mumbai.\n\n## Raj Imperia Floor Plans\n\n**Name:** 1 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 441 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹1.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n**Name:** 2 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 699 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹1.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n**Name:** 3 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 841 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹1.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n## Raj Imperia Price\n\n| Name | Carpet Area | Price | Furnishing Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 441 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹1.00 | Unfurnished |\n| 2 BHK | 699 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹1.00 | Unfurnished |\n| 3 BHK | 841 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹1.00 | Unfurnished |\n\n## Raj Imperia Amenities\n\n24/7 CCTV Surveillance & Security\n\nChildren Play Area\n\nDecorative main door\n\nEfficient Entry and Exits\n\nGrand Entrance Lobby\n\nGranite kitchen platform with branded SS sink\n\nGymnasium\n\nSeating Area\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n## Raj Imperia Features\n\n100% Power Backup In Common Areas\n\nAnti-skid tiles adorn the Balcony and Toilets\n\nElegant Building Entrance Gate\n\nExhaust Fan Provision Granite Kitchen platform\n\nLuxurious Vitrified Tiles grace the Living/Dining area, Master Bedroom\n\n## Raj Imperia Walkthrough Video\n\n## Raj Imperia Location\n\n  \n\n**Raj Imperia Address (Sales Gallery/Office/Experience Center):**   \nMalad West\n\n## Raj Imperia Location Advantages\n\n• SV Road\n\n2 min\n\n• Railway Station\n\n5 min\n\n• Life wave Hospital\n\n10 min\n\n• Suchak Hospital\n\n15 min\n\n• Inorbit Mall\n\n20 min\n\n## Developer\n\n![01JJKSRRD9SQA004HQC5FYXRAY](https://digipaces.com/storage/developer-logos/01JJKSRRD9SQA004HQC5FYXRAY.png)\n\nRaj Realty\n\nEstablished in 2005-06, this real estate development company has rapidly grown, completing over 25 projects across Mumbai's western suburbs and beyond. With a strong presence in the Mira-Bhayander region, the company has successfully executed more than a dozen projects in the area, earning a reputation for timely delivery and uncompromising quality.\n\nDedicated to continuous growth, the company consistently upgrades its development techniques to enhance quality and ensure timely execution. It prioritizes customer satisfaction, viewing each project not just as a concrete structure but as a realization of buyers' dreams. Backed by a team of highly qualified experts and professionals, the company has built a reputation as dependable and trustworthy developers committed to quality construction, timely delivery, and exceptional service.\n\n## Raj Imperia FAQ's\n\nRaj Imperia offers 1 BHK (441 sqft), 2 BHK (699 sqft), and 3 BHK (841 sqft) apartments with starting prices beginning at ₹1.19 Cr.\n\nThe possession date for Raj Imperia is October 1, 2027.\n\n## Raj Imperia Maharashtra RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Malad West\n\n[Chaitanya Ethics Orovia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/chaitanya-ethics-orovia)   [Malad Vrindavan CHSL](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west