n](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Raj Manor, Malad West by Rajesh LifeSpaces\n\n## Raj Manor Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Raj Manor.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1030 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.19 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRaj Manor's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Raj Manor | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 30400 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 29400 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 29900 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30000 | 27900 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malad West ranges from ₹ 19.9 K to ₹ 1.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Raj Manor | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Raj Manor.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Raj Manor, amounting to ₹ 3 Cr till August 2026.\n\nRent in Raj Manor ranges from ₹ 38 K to ₹ 70 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Raj Manor moved from ₹ 29,400/sqft to ₹ 30,400/sqft, reflecting a 3.40% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Raj Manor From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 23.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 3 Cr | ₹ 23,700 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Raj Manor Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1030 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Raj Manor, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.19 Cr\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Raj Manor\n\n#