d to customers. The tally of Rajesh Lifespaces projects covers more than 8 million sq. ft. with another 13.5 million sq. ft. of ongoing projects in Mumbai’s western and central suburbs. 16.2 million sq. ft. of upcoming projects will also be developed in these zones. Business ethics are taken very seriously here along with adherence to transparency in all business dealings, integrity, usage of quality technologies, high construction standards, unmatched customer service, etc. It also builds commercial spaces at key areas apart from big ticket complexes in Vikhroli, Bhandup among other places. A resort, 5 star hotel and other retail spaces will soon be developed as well.\n\n![Raj Infinia residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raj-infinia-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2, 4 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rajesh Raj Mulund residential project in Mulund West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-flagshipimg2.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMulund West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rajesh Raj Splendour Mumbai residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rajesh-raj-splendour-mumbai-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rajesh Raj Splendour residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rajesh-raj-splendour-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Raj Garden residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raj-garden-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Deepak Mahal CHS residential project in Worli](https://